        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9447/100 Fancy Solid Brass Cabinet Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Decorative Series Cabinet Pull brings to mind images of the days of unabashed ornate decorating.  This pull invokes this centuries old  styling with a stunning ring pull that is both expensive looking and lovely. It is a great choice for those looking for an inexpensive way to enhance the old world richness of their home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Similar design <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=41701\"><b>Omnia Ornate Cabinet Pulls</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's line of sophisticated cabinet hardware have been painstakingly crafted by artisans who understand that a beautiful design must be as comfortable to the hand as it is pleasing to the eyes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Decorative Series Omnia 9447 Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction regardless of finish.</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-3/8\"\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\n*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
